# Design and site conventions

- Visual system: **neumorphism** — soft raised/inset surfaces, dual light+dark shadows, shared soft base color. No hard flat Material cards as the primary look.
- Brand: **San Marina Engineering Limited**. Tagline: *Engineering Reliable Power. Building a Sustainable Future.*
- Prefer expressive fonts (project uses configured Google fonts). Do not fall back to Inter, Roboto, Arial, or system UI stacks in new UI.
- Avoid purple gradients, generic AI-landing aesthetics, and dark-mode-by-default.
- Static marketing site only — no auth, no CMS backend, no dynamic server features.
- Keep accessibility in mind: sufficient text contrast on soft surfaces; visible focus states on interactive neu controls.
